{"id":"62bd3047aecd5d0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-absolute-formula.md","title":"ZFC Absolute Formula","display":"df-zfc-absolute-formula — ZFC Absolute Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-absolute-formula","aliases":["58-df-zfc-absolute-formula"],"display":"df-zfc-absolute-formula — ZFC Absolute Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-absolute-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-absolute-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-absolute-formula — ZFC Absolute Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\\)</span> 与满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\varphi[s]\">\\(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\\land(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow N\\models\\varphi[s])\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\\land(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow N\\models\\varphi[s])\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>签名是绝对性关系的必要参数；旧式三元谓词隐藏了签名，并把结构对象误写成集合包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq N\">\\(M\\subseteq N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若专门讨论集合论的传递模型，可在该定义外再加入两论域的传递性及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{\\in\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{\\in\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models\\varphi[s]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsoluteFormula}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s)\\land(M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow N\\models\\varphi[s])\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"M\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{\\in\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1406","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-absolute-formula.md|58-df-zfc-absolute-formula]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348e